OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1           
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWho will be Robert Pattinson's 'Bond   
OL,4,Agirl' - and does the role need to      
OL,5,Achange?                                
OL,7,FWhoever is cast opposite him, though,  
OL,8,Fneeds to have a "very strong identity  
OL,9,Fof her own", believes film critic      
OL,10,FLarushka Ivan-Zadeh - "someone         
OL,11,Fdistinctive, sexy, complicated".       
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
